<title>SWEDEN: SAS to temporarily cut some Europe fares.</title>
<headline>SAS to temporarily cut some Europe fares.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airline SAS said on Friday it would cut fares to around 50 European destinations by about 20 to 25 percent on its cut rate Jackpot tourist class tickets from January 20 to March 23.  </p>
<p>&quot;With this price move, we want to stimulate increased tourist travelling during a period when we have free capacity,&quot; said SAS spokesman Jan Molarin in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
